{
  "bookId": "rewind-56",
  "id": "chapter-232",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43216001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "你们以为找到这里就算结束了么？抱歉，没有那么简单。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "我不会，也不可能让到手的稀金卡牌落入其他人的手中。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "我以「马南家族」的名义，誓死捍卫主人的荣光。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "那么，你就下地狱去吧——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "我说，这种时候的帅气台词应该也有我的一份吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯，准备迎战，全力夺回全套稀金卡牌。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>启动作战模式，锁定目标「洛瑞丝」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43216008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "呵呵，放轻松，我会不遗余力地好好怜爱你们的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "可恶，竟然让那女人跑了！我还没找她算账呢，便宜她了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "还以为会是多难啃的骨头，到头来也不过如此。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "希塔刚才和我配合得那么天衣无缝，还是和小时候一样啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……只是为了完成任务，你不要多想。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "快来！我找到全部的稀金卡牌了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "我有一个大胆的想法，不如……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "想都别想，我不会让你再次得逞的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯，录入所有稀金卡牌的信息，同步到管理局数据库。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>正在录入信息……录入完成，已同步递送管理局。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43223010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "得，白忙活了一场。不过只要希塔开心，我这波就不算亏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1147",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "ladon",
          "rowIds": [
            43216001,
            43216002,
            43216003,
            43216004,
            43216005,
            43216006,
            43216007,
            43216008
          ],
          "sectionId": 43216
        },
        {
          "bundle": "ladon",
          "rowIds": [
            43223001,
            43223002,
            43223003,
            43223004,
            43223005,
            43223006,
            43223007,
