          ],
          "sectionId": 43223
        }
      ],
      "title": "决断之时 · Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43217001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "这位就是稀金卡牌的主人，现在该物归原主了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "呃，真的要还回去啊？我现在后悔还来得及吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43217004",
              "text": "不可以，这些卡牌对我很重要。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43217003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "给你也不是不行，但是你要拿值钱的东西和我交换才可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看上什么随便挑，只要我有，前提是要把这套卡牌还给我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "难得碰到像你这样大方的人，我会好好「清剿」的~\n喏，卡牌全都给你，拿去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "等一下，这张卡牌似乎隐藏着什么……可以给我看看么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯，扫描这张卡牌内的芯片。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>尝试读取芯片中的加密信息……读取完成。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "现在，转述加密信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "留言",
          "text": "「记忆中的少女，潜藏于群星之间的隐秘路径。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "留言",
          "text": "「23.9667°，97.0000°，等待你来唤醒。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43217014",
              "text": "这是什么……？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43217014",
              "text": "新颖的恶作剧吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43217013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43217014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "或许，我可以尝试破解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1148",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "ladon",
          "rowIds": [
            43217001,
            43217002,
            43217003,
            43217004,
            43217005,
            43217006,
            43217007,
            43217008,
            43217009,
            43217010,
            43217011,
            43217012,
            43217013,
            43217014
          ],
          "sectionId": 43217
        }
      ],
      "title": "决断之时 · Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43218001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "解密完成，这是一条坐标信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "指向M城郊外的一个位置，其他信息不明。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43218004",
              "text": "M城郊外……难道和优纪有关？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43218003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "种种迹象表明，与失踪的优纪有很大的关联。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "事已至此，只要还有一线希望，都有必要亲自到这里查探清楚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "只是，寄送这条信息的神秘人身份不明，其中想必会有潜藏危险。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43218008",
              "text": "我和你一起去！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43218007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我理解你心情急切，但这会让你陷入未知的危险。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43218010",
              "text": "这可是找回优纪她们的唯一机会。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43218009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "既然如此，我会做个风险评估，确保你的安全。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "谢谢，没有你们的支持，我肯定坚持不到现在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我和你一样，也想早点见到优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "风险评估已完成，一切准备就绪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43218014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就出发吧，这次我一定要带优纪回家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1149",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "ladon",
          "rowIds": [
            43218001,
            43218002,
            43218003,
            43218004,
            43218005,
            43218006,
            43218007,
            43218008,
